# Hospital Queue Management System

A Hospital Queue Management System developed using Spring Boot and MySQL to efficiently manage patient queues and reduce waiting time in hospitals.

## Features
- Patient registration
- Queue management system
- Token generation
- Patient record management
- Admin functionality
- Database connectivity using MySQL

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Spring Boot
- MySQL
- HTML
- CSS
- Maven

## Project Objective
The objective of this project is to simplify hospital queue handling and improve patient management efficiency through automation.

## Project Structure
├── src/main/java  
├── src/main/resources  
├── src/test/java  
├── pom.xml  
└── README.md  

## How to Run the Project
1. Clone the repository
2. Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code
3. Configure MySQL database
4. Run the Spring Boot application
5. Open the browser and access the application

## Future Enhancements
- Online appointment booking
- SMS/email notifications
- Doctor availability tracking
- Dashboard analytics
- Real-time queue updates

